  - NodeGuid: 30a00c0b-5934-4472-8f30-5df2f112fe3a
    Position: {x: 3891, y: 2}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: RichardMidnightRoseDialogueEvent
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: I trust you will find and apprehend the culprit, Detective.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 38cafc9e-a802-4f30-bb28-f35ef2debc2c
    Position: {x: 3627, y: 2}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Since I arrived I have been harassed by a bunch of gray
        bumpkin cats! One of them is a  regular over at the Cattelatte.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 5bb69ed3-28eb-4aef-aa51-25b5cf940284
    Position: {x: 1856, y: -196}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: A Midnight Rose? Yes, I bought one recently for an office
        party. Great party by the way! I will make sure to invite you next time!
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: b85e8ffa-f857-4aea-834e-803ea01ccebf
    Position: {x: 1856, y: 581}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Is that one of the orange cats? I don't think I've seen
        the toy before. Now, if you'll excuse me, Detective.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 23bff266-e6e3-491f-8f78-08ffd2ceaadb
    Position: {x: 2121, y: 217}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: The moment all the colors vanished really shocked me!
        Like BAM! and they were gone!
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 47e41c03-211b-4f46-911c-ba2ee22c300c
    Position: {x: -99, y: -172}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Detective! I was cattergasted that YOU stole all the colors!
        But, I understand. I really learned a lession.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: c2734396-3245-4da4-a5c7-f6649dc8804f
    Position: {x: 778, y: 308}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: 'We are expanding into imports in this region, and I have
        personally cultivated a good business relationship with the local government. '
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 3bc8a010-d4c5-4e58-8393-b0208119683e
    Position: {x: 498, y: 789}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Oh, listen to me! You will have to excuse me Detective.
